    region 5-1-deprecated-features-a-href-https-docs-oracle-com-en-database-oracle-application-express-20-2-htmrn-index-html-htmrn-guid-657ff369-756e-4f31-96f9-b2d92c3de084-target-blank-release-notes-a (
        name: 5.1 Deprecated Features - <a href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/database/oracle/application-express/20.2/htmrn/index.html#HTMRN-GUID-657FF369-756E-4F31-96F9-B2D92C3DE084" target="_blank">Release Notes</a>
